From 8ffa4873d1f2691e622edec85706c372f5e347bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tyler South <tsouth2@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 23:56:41 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Drag dropped files into the app under the pointer

A Windows drop on an Omarchy app other than a Files folder used to stop at Downloads. The files still go to Downloads, and then a small overlay drag source (GTK 4 with gtk4-layer-shell, no keyboard focus) appears beside the drop point and asks the launcher for drop-drag over the agent port. The launcher presses on it through the virtual tablet and drags to the recorded drop point, so the app receives an ordinary Wayland drop of the files. The Downloads notice now only appears when that does not happen: the launcher refuses when the pointer moved, the window lost focus or the drop is old, and the helper gives up after a few seconds. Revision 38 delivers the helper to existing guests.
